  "goodToKnow": "Bescheuert is informal and means stupid, crazy or daft: Das ist doch bescheuert! Aimed at a person (Bist du bescheuert?), it can be offensive, so avoid it with strangers or at work. It's a mild insult, but still an insult. Among friends, it can also mean charmingly silly. In formal speech, use unvernünftig, unsinnig or verrückt. Its origin is uncertain, possibly linked to scheuern, but don't rely on that."
